# Black Ward's "This effect doesn't remove this Aura" spares it from its own protection only: another instance of
# protection from black still removes it once it is black (CR 702.16n, 704.5m). Black Ward enchants a creature, any
# player's (CR 303.4a): Bot1 cannot cast it on its Mox Jet (the refusal) but enchants Bot2's White Knight, which has
# protection from black of its own. While the Ward is white it stays; Painter's Servant naming black makes it black
# (CR 105.3), and the Knight's protection puts it into Bot1's graveyard.

